<title>NETHERLANDS: Reed-Elsevier to buy Colofon.</title>
<headline>Reed-Elsevier to buy Colofon.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Dutch publishing group Reed-Elsevier said on Monday it would purchase Dutch publisher Colofon BV for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Colofon had a turnover in 1995/96 of 70 million guilders.  </p>
<p>Reed-Elsevier said in a statement it expected the acquisition to have a positive impact on earnings per share.</p>
<p>Colofon, a holding company for three specialised business and scientific publishers -- Delwel, VUGA and De Tijdstroom -- will be integrated into Elsevier Business Information.</p>
<p>Reed-Elsevier described the move an important step forward, adding it would boost opportunities for growth at both parties.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
